{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Boole环"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"“Boole 环”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>Boole 环是所有元素都幂等的环.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Boole代数","text":"Boole 代数"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}